cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "inspireauth: INSPIRE-HEP author records for Latin America"
abstract: >-
  JSON records of 57,588 authors with Latin American affiliations in
  INSPIRE-HEP (data/inspire_LA.json), including identifiers, institutions,
  positions, advisors, papers and inferred gender, together with the
  notebooks used to build them.
